5278e40b5f2d88e385f3868f0fab3.mp4?t=1749091921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Tactics: Surround, Ambush, Raid, Block!</h2>Every team fight is a tactical operation requiring strong communication. Use the complex, shifting terrain to your advantage, predict the movements of both allies and foes, choose the best positions and paths, and work closely with your teammates to dominate the battlefield, take down opponents, and capture key points.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Give Up!</h2>Remember, in the rumble, the last team stands wins.  Hold your fort, hold your line, counter, attack and remember, everything is possible in Quad Battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525990/extras/138934b41b18c4c0aaf4602da48e8936.poster.avif?t=1749091921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525990/extras/138934b41b18c4c0aaf4602da48e8936.webm?t=1749091921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525990/extras/138934b41b18c4c0aaf4602da48e8936.mp4?t=1749091921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
